&lt;li&gt;Drive cost-of-goods optimization and continuous improvement initiatives in partnership with assigned CDMOs to support long-term commercial strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Quality Interface&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
