&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory agency interactions, pre-approval inspections, and ongoing inspection readiness at assigned external manufacturing sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Quality Assurance on quality agreements, audit programs, and remediation planning for assigned CDMOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of compliance, data integrity, and continuous improvement across the external manufacturing network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
