&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings deep biotech/pharma category expertise (e.g., CROs, CDMOs, clinical services, capital equipment, and overall direct spend), strong negotiation capabilities, and experience building scalable procurement processes to support a growing global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in onsite with an expectation to be in the office five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
