&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 years of pharmaceutical, biotech, PBM, payer, or GPO experience, with a strong background in market access analytics, payer policy, or managed markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate complex data into clear, actionable insights that inform payer strategy and communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build credibility and influence cross-functionally without direct authority in a highly matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and collaborative, able to operate with strategic independence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High executive presence and polished presentation skills, with the ability to present confidently to internal senior leadership and external payer and PBM audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to travel approximately 25% for payer and PBM meetings, industry conferences, and periodic visits to Arrowhead’s corporate headquarters in Pasadena, California.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the Commercial, Medicare Part D, and Medicaid managed care books of business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical, with experience working across formulary and policy data (e.g., MMIT), pharmacy claims, HUB and specialty pharmacy data, and payer performance reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or partnering with National Account Directors or Key Account Managers on payer engagement and negotiations highly desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s / Advanced Degree (MBA, MPH, PharmD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;California pay range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Arrowhead provides competitive salaries and an excellent benefit package.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
