&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8wu247&quot; data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;2951&quot;&gt;Strong attention to detail and commitment to quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1syaxo4&quot; data-start=&quot;2952&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently while collaborating effectively within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1syaxo4&quot; data-start=&quot;2952&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
