&lt;li&gt;Track progress against project timelines, generate regular status updates, and communicate progress and issues to management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform tasks across multiple projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage time effectively to meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to safe laboratory practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
