&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking an Information Security Analyst&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;with a foundational background in IT support, system administration, or security operations and an interest in growing their career in information security. This role will support the implementation, monitoring, and maintenance of security controls across endpoint, identity, and Microsoft 365 environments. The ideal candidate is detail-oriented, eager to learn, and comfortable working with established processes, documentation, and security tools under the guidance of senior team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with monitoring security alerts and escalate issues to senior team members as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support endpoint security and compliance efforts within Microsoft Intune and related Microsoft security tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain device compliance policies, configuration profiles, and security settings following established standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in testing and validation of security changes, policy updates, and endpoint configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with user and device access reviews, MFA support, and identity-related security tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help document procedures, standards, and troubleshooting steps in runbooks or internal knowledge bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with IT teams to investigate security issues, configuration inconsistencies, and endpoint compliance gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with routine reporting, tracking remediation items, and following up on assigned security tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to security awareness and continuous improvement efforts as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use PowerShell and/or Intune remediation scripts to automate repetitive tasks, reporting, and configuration drift checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Information Security, Information Technology, Computer Science, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 + years of experience in Information Security, System Administration, Help Desk or similar roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to MDM/MAM policies for Windows/MacOS/iOS/Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands-on experience administering Microsoft Defender Portal, in the following areas: Sentinel, Secure Score, Cloud Apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to investigate alerts, interpret audit logs, and distinguish signal from noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to follow established procedures, manage assigned tasks, and escalate when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
