&lt;p&gt;Arrowhead Pharmaceuticals is seeking a strategic and experienced Manager, Order-to-Cash (O2C) to help establish, lead, and scale the global O2C function in support of the company&#39;s first commercial product launch and future growth initiatives. This role is responsible for supporting the vision, strategy, governance, and execution of end-to-end commercial revenue cycle processes while ensuring operational excellence, scalable infrastructure, strong internal controls, and exceptional customer service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key member of the Finance organization, the Manager will optimize O2C operations, develop cross-functional operating models, and serve as a trusted business partner to Commercial, Supply Chain, Market Access, Legal, Accounting, and external trading partners. The ideal candidate brings expertise in life sciences commercialization, commercial product launches, and finance transformation, with experience implementing processes, systems, and controls that support business growth and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is full-time onsite, 5 days a week in Verona, WI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
