&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and execution of the global O2C strategy, operating model, and roadmap to support commercial product distribution and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance scalable processes and controls that support global expansion, new product launches, and increasing transaction complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own O2C policies, performance metrics, and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Launch &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Commercial, Market Access, and Finance leadership to develop customer onboarding, contracting, pricing administration, and customer service processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure commercial agreements, customer terms, rebate programs, and related activities are effectively operationalized and executed in compliance with company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems, Transformation &amp;amp; Process Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation, optimization, and governance of O2C capabilities within Microsoft Dynamics 365 and related commercial systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute automation initiatives utilizing EDI, workflow automation, system integrations, analytics, and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Controls and Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Internal Audit and External Audit teams to maintain effective controls and ensure SOX compliance across all O2C activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
