&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business Administration, Life Sciences, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five years of progressive experience in O2C, Revenue Operations, Finance Operations, or Shared Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, optimizing, and scaling O2C functions within biotechnology, pharmaceutical, medical device, or other highly regulated industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant ERP implementation, optimization, or transformation experience, preferably with Microsoft Dynamics 365.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of revenue cycle processes and SOX compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work independently, prioritize competing priorities, and manage multiple projects and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills with the ability to influence across multiple levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate to advanced proficiency in Microsoft Office applications, including Excel, Word, Outlook, and PowerPoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
