&lt;li&gt;10+&amp;nbsp; pharmaceutical/biotech experience with a strong background in field-based market access, payer engagement, or managed markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of previous national account payer experience with established, deep-rooted relationships across government payer channels, including Managed Medicaid (MCOs), Fee-for-Service Medicaid, the Department of Veterans Affairs, DoD/TRICARE, Indian Health Service, and Humana Medicare, are required&lt;/li&gt;
