&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lvzb0q&quot; data-start=&quot;1445&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Contribute to the design and optimization of novel peptide constructs that support RNAi therapeutic development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ab2gts&quot; data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1665&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate and well-organized experimental records using electronic laboratory notebooks (ELNs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zlkoiq&quot; data-start=&quot;1666&quot; data-end=&quot;1801&quot;&gt;Present scientific findings and participate in project team discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;144c3zn&quot; data-start=&quot;1877&quot; data-end=&quot;1986&quot;&gt;Maintain laboratory equipment and ensure compliance with laboratory safety procedures and company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xczfce&quot; data-start=&quot;1987&quot; data-end=&quot;2095&quot;&gt;Stay current with emerging technologies and scientific literature in peptide chemistry and drug discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
