&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cxdey7&quot; data-start=&quot;3026&quot; data-end=&quot;3104&quot;&gt;Experience with high-throughput peptide synthesis or screening technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m6t2eq&quot; data-start=&quot;3105&quot; data-end=&quot;3190&quot;&gt;Familiarity with biophysical assays used to characterize biomolecular interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16nw61w&quot; data-start=&quot;3191&quot; data-end=&quot;3285&quot;&gt;Experience working on oligonucleotide, peptide, or RNA-based therapeutic discovery programs.&lt;/li&gt;
