&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in finance or life sciences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years of experience in finance, buyer, or purchasing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and a self-starter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, prioritize tasks, and manage timeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills at all levels within an organization&lt;/li&gt;
