&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.S, M.S or PhD in Chemistry (or related area of study)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD. with 5+ years of relevant experience / M.S. with 7+ years of relevant experience / B.S. with 10+ years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
