&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working in close partnership with the Director of Commercial Technology and business owners across Commercial, Marketing, Medical Affairs, Pricing &amp;amp; Market Access, and Trade &amp;amp; Distribution, this individual will translate business requirements into scalable technology solutions that improve efficiency, enhance decision-making, and support Arrowhead&#39;s rapidly expanding commercial organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role combines hands-on platform ownership with project leadership, vendor management, analytics development, and AI-enabled process improvement. The successful candidate will help improve Arrowhead&#39;s commercial technology ecosystem while supporting U.S. operations, future product launches, and international expansion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to play a key role in shaping the future of Commercial Technology at Arrowhead by helping scale systems, analytics, AI capabilities, and digital solutions that support the company&#39;s continued growth and commercialization efforts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is based in Pasadena, California, with an expectation to be in office 5 days a week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
