&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage platform configuration, releases, testing, integrations, and production support across CRM, Specialty Pharmacy, MMIT, Marketing Cloud, and other commercial data sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own Master Data Management (MDM) processes within ZAIDYN, ensuring accurate and consistent customer data across commercial applications and reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide secondary administration and operational support for Veeva Commercial CRM, PromoMats, and MedComms, including interface monitoring, release management, testing, and issue resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Translate business requirements into scalable technology solutions by partnering closely with business owners, IT teams, and external vendors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
