&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure the delivery of reliable, high-quality commercial data and reporting that supports operational and executive decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Continuously improve reporting capabilities, data quality, and analytics processes to enhance the user experience and business insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;AI, Digital Transformation &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Executive Director of AI &amp;amp; Enterprise Data Management to evaluate, pilot, and implement AI-enabled solutions, automation, and data strategies that improve efficiency and business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive adoption of new technologies by partnering with business stakeholders, promoting best practices, supporting training, and ensuring successful implementation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Continuously evaluate opportunities to simplify processes, strengthen internal capabilities, optimize vendor services, and reduce total cost of ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
