&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional technology initiatives, coordinating project plans, resources, risks, testing, vendor activities, and stakeholder communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate commercial technology readiness for international expansion, future product launches, and enhancements supporting the continued growth of the U.S. commercial organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships with Commercial, Marketing, Medical Affairs, Pricing &amp;amp; Market Access, and Trade &amp;amp; Distribution teams by delivering responsive, reliable technology solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
