&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Life Sciences, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience supporting commercial technology, commercial operations, analytics, or business systems within the biotechnology, pharmaceutical, or life sciences industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong Power BI reporting and dashboard development experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing technology vendors, budgets, and cross-functional projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of AI, automation, and digital technologies supporting commercial organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
