&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to independently drive execution while collaborating effectively with leadership and business owners in a fast-paced, growing organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
