&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting Veeva Commercial CRM, PromoMats, and MedComms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
