&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;26&quot; data-end=&quot;450&quot;&gt;The EHS Senior Specialist reports to the Site Environmental, Health &amp;amp; Safety (EHS) Manager and supports the planning, implementation, and continuous improvement of EHS programs for the Madison facility. This role helps develop and maintain a comprehensive occupational health and safety program, including safety inspections, incident investigations, laboratory-focused EHS training, and environmental compliance activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;639&quot;&gt;The EHS Senior Specialist will help ensure compliance with applicable federal, state, and local environmental, health, and safety regulations while promoting a strong site safety culture.&lt;/p&gt;
