&lt;li data-start=&quot;1315&quot; data-end=&quot;1387&quot; data-section-id=&quot;snee1w&quot;&gt;Maintain required EHS records and support timely regulatory reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1389&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot; data-section-id=&quot;qhc3iq&quot;&gt;Review and support risk assessments related to process hazards, new equipment and processes, chemicals, biological materials, and personal protective equipment (PPE).&lt;/li&gt;
