&lt;li data-start=&quot;1950&quot; data-end=&quot;2081&quot; data-section-id=&quot;108fdr9&quot;&gt;Serve as the EHS representative on projects involving new equipment, process improvements, facility changes, and PPE assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
