&lt;li data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2257&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1h8ppys&quot;&gt;Perform other duties as assigned based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2393&quot; data-section-id=&quot;5pzpur&quot;&gt;Comply with all applicable regulations, company policies, standard operating procedures, work instructions, and safety requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
