&lt;li&gt;Assist with tax audits and other tax-related inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for documenting policies, tax positions, calculations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain internal controls to comply with SOX regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
