&lt;p&gt;This position falls within the Quality Control structure, under the Quality Assurance Organization. A Quality Control Team Leader will manage chemists and help to support the analytical testing of pharmaceutical raw materials and raw materials activities for new drug substances and drug products while carrying out a supervisory function.&lt;/p&gt;
