&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M.S. in Chemistry (or related field) with 5+ years relevant laboratory experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.S. in Chemistry (or related field) with 7+ years of relevant laboratory experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully knowledgeable of cGMP and ICH laboratory requirements and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient and demonstrated experience with analytical instrumentation, test methodology/validations/transfers, data acquisition systems, and typical cGMP policies/practices&lt;/li&gt;
